      "source": "As of 5.2 this resolver returns <code>false</code> if a parameter of type\n<code>Map</code> is also annotated. As of 6.2 this resolver returns <code>false</code>\nfor a parameter of type <a href=\"../../../../../ui/ModelMap.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ui\"><code>ModelMap</code></a>.",
